    <div class="accordion__panel" id="accPanel1">
      <div class="accordion__panel-inner">
        <h3 class="accordion__subheading">Settings you may find useful:</h3>
        <p>You can use an Accesskey shortcut, at any time to return to this accordion.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Chrome, Opera and Edge, Windows: Alt + 6</li>
          <li>Firefox on Windows: Shift + Alt + 6</li>
          <li>Chrome, Safari and Edge, MacOS Control + Option + 6</li>
          <li>Firefox, MacOS: Control + Option + 6 or Control + Alt + 6  </li>
          <li>Opera, MacOS: Control + Alt + 6</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Advent calendars are like a treasure hunt, by design - the doors are out of sequence and the door labels are intentionally difficult to find. But, that won't work for everyone, so I added some accessibility settings so it does work for everyone:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>If you wish the grid to be displayed in ascending numerical order, to make discovery or tabbing easier for you, you can flip that switch</li>
          <li>If you're struggling to find the labels, you can increase the label visibility</li>
          <li>Should the background image make discovery too challenging, you can dim it</li>
          <li>Each door and modal animation lasts for 1.5s, you can switch that off, if you wish</li>
          <li>You can disable already opened doors, to reduce the tab stops</li>
        </ul>
  
        <div class="toggles__wrapper">
          <div class="input__group">
            <button class="toggle__switch" aria-pressed="false" id="numericalOrder" data-pref="numerical">
              <span class="toggle__thumb"></span>
            </button>
            <label for="numericalOrder" class="toggle__label">Show advent in numerical order</label>
          </div>
          <div class="input__group">
            <button class="toggle__switch" aria-pressed="false" id="visibility" data-pref="visibility">
              <span class="toggle__thumb"></span>
            </button>
            <label for="visibility" class="toggle__label">Increase label visibility</label>
          </div>
